  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your clever tactics and forceful leadership help your crew tackle any task.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Leadership, Profession (sailor) 7 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you are on board a ship, you can use the aid another action to assist every ally on board that is performing a type of action specified by you, either performing a skill or making an attack. Alternatively, you can use aid another to assist them defensively, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to Armor Class and a +1 bonus on Reflex saves until the beginning of your next turn. Any ally that is your follower increases the bonus they gain from the aid another action by 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
